{
  "servers": {
    "github": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_GITHUB_PAT"
      }
    },
    "azure": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@azure/mcp@latest", "server", "start"]
    },
    "playwright": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@playwright/mcp@latest"]
    }
  }
}
```

This way the repo documents how to set it up without ever containing a real token. Add a note in your `README.md`:
```
cp .vscode/mcp.json.example .vscode/mcp.json
# Then replace YOUR_GITHUB_PAT with your token